          ],
          "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.089,
            0.364,
            0.108
          ],
          "content": "7）8mol/L尿素溶液。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.118,
            0.297,
            0.142
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "【方法与步骤】"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.151,
            0.527,
            0.173
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "（一）植物染色体 Giemsa C 带技术"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.185,
            0.302,
            0.204
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "1. 染色体标本制备"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.207,
            0.784,
            0.226
          ],
          "content": "按照去壁低渗法制备染色体标本，制好的标本需要空气干燥3\\~7天。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.228,
            0.241,
            0.246
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "2. 显带处理"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.249,
            0.64,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": "(1) 饱和  $\\mathrm{Ba(OH)_2}$  溶液处理 5～10min (20～25℃)。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.272,
            0.537,
            0.291
          ],
          "content": "(2) 蒸馏水彻底冲洗，以清除 $\\mathrm{Ba(OH)_2}$。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.294,
            0.512,
            0.312
          ],
          "content": "(3)  $2 \\times$  SSC 盐溶液  $60 \\sim 65^{\\circ}C$  保温 2h。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.315,
            0.477,
            0.335
          ],
          "content": "（4）蒸馏水冲洗 $5\\mathrm{min}$，空气干燥。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.337,
            0.906,
            0.377
          ],
          "content": "(5) pH6.8 磷酸缓冲液与 Giemsa 原液按 20:1 混合，染色 30min，自来水冲洗，空气干燥。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.379,
            0.429,
            0.4
          ],
          "content": "（6）镜检，拍照，带型分析。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.411,
            0.532,
            0.433
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "（二）植物染色体 Giemsa N 带技术"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.445,
            0.305,
            0.464
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "1. 染色体标本制备"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.466,
            0.786,
            0.486
          ],
          "content": "按照去壁低渗法制备染色体标本，制好的标本需要空气干燥3\\~7天。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.488,
            0.244,
            0.506
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "2. 显带处理"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.509,
            0.91,
            0.551
          ],
          "content": "(1) 将贮存一周以内的染色体标本, 用 $1 \\mathrm{~mol} / \\mathrm{L} \\mathrm{NaH}_{2} \\mathrm{PO}_{4}$ 溶液 $(94 \\pm 1)^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ 处理 $6 \\sim 15 \\mathrm{~min}$ 。准确的处理时间需自己摸索。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.554,
            0.45,
            0.573
          ],
          "content": "(2) $50^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}$ 左右蒸馏水冲洗3次。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.575,
            0.308,
            0.594
          ],
          "content": "(3) 空气干燥。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.597,
            0.909,
            0.637
          ],
          "content": "(4) pH6.8 Giemsa (20:1) 染色 30\\~60min，染色时间随处理时间不同而异， $NaH_{2}PO_{4}$  处理时间稍长，染色时间就要延长。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.64,
            0.43,
            0.659
          ],
          "content": "(5) 自来水冲洗，空气干燥。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.661,
            0.431,
            0.681
          ],
          "content": "(6) 镜检，拍照，带型分析。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.692,
            0.531,
            0.714
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "（三）植物染色体Giemsa G带技术"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.726,
            0.307,
            0.745
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "1. 染色体标本制备"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.748,
            0.911,
            0.79
          ],
          "content": "按照去壁低渗法制备染色体标本，预处理时可用饱和  $\\alpha$ -溴化萘或用 0.02% 秋水仙素处理 1.5～2h，然后在 70～80℃ 烘箱中烤 2h。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.792,
            0.246,
